---
description: Resolve the actual personal-welcome goal through semantic composition and exact native authorities.
args:
  goal: string
returns: WelcomeResult
---
Resolve the requested first-run, selected-resource or interrupted-check objective from actual owned Personal evidence and the installed setup/tour/explorer codebases. Configured preference, connected owner, verified readiness, saved tour frame and completed probe are different facts. Choose useful evidence and semantic continuation; preserve original observations when the question or refinement compares them with current state.

A similarly named resource, another sender/context or stale receipt is not current authority. Perform an exact local retry only when requested and natively admitted, consuming its real result and cleanup witness. Permission to retry or retain does not make the effect requested. Do not launch a different workspace or publish a finding. Return actual requested domain evidence and next-step findings, with only an authentic separately requested private handoff.

An initial inquiry has no previous value. When revisiting the private inquiry after real feedback, pass its actual prior result so historical source observations survive; do not substitute a new snapshot for the original merely because it is newer.
